<p>LEAD MGR - Dai-Ichi Kangyo Securities</p>
<p>FISCAL AGENT - Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank</p>
<p>TYPE unsecured callable bond</p>
<p> ISSUE NO 18	   AMT 10 bln yen</p>
